Comfort Zone- Something where you are comfortable being. I am a software engineer and I am comfortable in Java. This is my comfort zone.
Safety Circle- Something where you may not be comfortable but you feel safe to experiment without being judged or without the fear of failure.

A leader's responsibility is not to create comfort zone. Comfort zone is not necessarily good for that their team or the organisation. A leader should create a safety circle and push their team to operate outside the comfort zone. This is what I would call it as raising the bar.